post:/api/v5/mt4/accounts/job/transfer-a.summary:
Asynchronously transfer (create) MT4 trading accounts to one or more target servers via
background job. Each (account × target server) combination is processed independently;
returns immediately with a job id — poll `GET /api/v5/jobs/{jobId}` for progress + results.

post:/api/v5/mt4/managers/batch-create.summary:
Batch-create one or more MT4 managers on the specified server. Partial success allowed —
per-manager outcomes are returned in the details. Intended for test-data provisioning;
does not walk the approval flow (consistent with account batch operations).
